# The outbound-call sketch that used to live here described POST /start-marketing-call,
# an endpoint that was never implemented. Outbound calling now exists for real — see
# outbound.http in this directory for the working requests.
#
# The per-contact `instruction` / `greeting` shape sketched here survived: it maps to the
# body of POST /outbound-call. The `contacts` array (a campaign loop over many numbers)
# did not — the implemented endpoint dials one contact per request.

@base_url = http://localhost:5000/api/phone-call/twilio

### Place a single outbound call (see outbound.http for the full set)
POST {{base_url}}/outbound-call
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "+6285725868168",
  "instruction": "You are calling Friendly, the owner of Tolman Sdn Bhd, a construction company. Your tone should be relaxed when talking with this contact.",
  "greeting": "Hello, may I speak to Friendly, the owner of Tolman Sdn Bhd? This is Sarah calling from Meridian Properties"
}
